{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker that writes every record to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store"},{"type":"text","text":", so records survive the app ending, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" start with the ones "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store"},{"type":"text","text":" kept from earlier runs."}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Initializer","symbolKind":"init","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"title":"init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV5store7consent9enrichers8samplers12samplingSeed3nowACx_AA7ConsentVSgSayAA8EnricherVGSayAA7SamplerVGs6UInt64V20FoundationEssentials4DateVyYbctc11Persistence11RecordStoreRzlufc","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"store"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11Persistence11RecordStoreP","text":"RecordStore"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"consent"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV","text":"Consent"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"enrichers"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers8EnricherV","text":"Enricher"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"samplers"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV","text":"Sampler"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"samplingSeed"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V","text":"UInt64"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"now"},{"kind":"text","text":": () -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV","text":"Date"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L122","fileName":"Tracker.swift"}},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"store"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11Persistence11RecordStoreP","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/RecordStore","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"RecordStore"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"consent"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Consent"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"enrichers"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers8EnricherV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Enricher"},{"kind":"text","text":"] = [], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"samplers"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sampler"},{"kind":"text","text":"] = [], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"samplingSeed"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UInt64"},{"kind":"text","text":" = .random(in: .min ... .max), "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"now"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@escaping "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@Sendable"},{"kind":"text","text":" () -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Date"},{"kind":"text","text":" = { Date.now })"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Where each record is kept until it is delivered."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"store"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The user’s consent, which each event’s category must have before it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"written and delivered; "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", every event delivered, by default."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"consent"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What each event’s context gains, applied in order by the tracker’s worker."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"enrichers"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Which events, or groups of events, to keep a fraction of, decided by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s worker after the enrichers and before the store; none by default, so every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event is kept."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"samplers"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The seed the samplers’ decisions come from: fix it and which events are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"kept is fixed too. Drawn from the system’s random number generator once, as the tracker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is made, by default. Fix it only in tests and replays: every launch with the same seed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"makes the same decision for its first matching event, its second and so on, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fixed seed shipped to every device keeps the same events everywhere rather than the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sampler’s rate of them."}]}],"name":"samplingSeed"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The wall-clock time each event is stamped with when it is tracked. It runs on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracking caller’s thread, so keep it fast.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"now"}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracker’s worker writes each record as it reaches it, before publishing it to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", rather than a stage reading "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", which runs in the delivery’s task,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"later, perhaps after a slow batch. Given "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"consent"},{"type":"text","text":", a record is written once its category"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is granted, not while it is held, and the recovered records are gated again. The worker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes the recovered records from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store"},{"type":"text","text":" before anything tracked."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Given "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"samplers"},{"type":"text","text":", a record they drop is never written. A record the store recovered was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sampled in the run that wrote it, so it isn’t sampled again."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingseed:now:)"]}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker","title":"Tracker","abstract":[{"text":"What app code tracks events with: it records each event, with the time, the caller’s source","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"location and the task’s context, as one of its ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker"},"doc://Persistence/documentation/Persistence/RecordStore":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RecordStore"}],"url":"\/documentation\/persistence\/recordstore","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where a tracker keeps each record until it is delivered, so records survive the app ending."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"RecordStore","identifier":"doc:\/\/Persistence\/documentation\/Persistence\/RecordStore","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RecordStore"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"store","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RecordStore","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11Persistence11RecordStoreP"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"consent"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Consent"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"enrichers"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers8EnricherV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Enricher"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"samplers"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7SamplerV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sampler"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"samplingSeed"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UInt64"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"now"},{"kind":"text","text":": () -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials4DateV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Date"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingseed:now:)","title":"init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/init(store:consent:enrichers:samplers:samplingSeed:now:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker that writes every record to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store"},{"type":"text","text":", so records survive the app ending, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" start with the ones "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"store"},{"type":"text","text":" kept from earlier runs."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackers","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","abstract":[],"type":"topic","title":"Trackers"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/records-swift.property":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The records of the events this tracker tracks, for a delivery to read."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"records"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Tracker","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Records","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV7RecordsV"}],"title":"records","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/records-swift.property"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Consent"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent","abstract":[{"text":"The user’s consent, category by category, which a tracker given it applies to every event.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Consent"}],"title":"Consent"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Enricher":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Enricher","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adds to the context of each event a tracker tracks, before the record is delivered."}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/enricher","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Enricher","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"Enricher"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Sampler":{"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/sampler","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once."}],"type":"topic","title":"Sampler"}}}